---
title: "dynamic_field::borrow (Sui Move Concepts: Dynamic Field Read Access)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_addr: object_addr = object.to_address()
    q_get_addr --> q_hash: hash = hash_type_and_key(object_addr, name)
    q_hash --> q_borrow: field = borrow_child_object(object, hash)
    q_borrow --> q_check_type: verify Field type matches expected Name and Value
    q_check_type --> q_return: types match
    q_check_type --> q_abort_type: type mismatch
    q_return --> [*]: return &field.value

    q_abort_type --> [*]: abort - Value type mismatch

    note right of q_hash
        INV-001: Borrow uses same hash derivation as add
        INV-002: Field lookup is O(1) via hash
    end note

    note right of q_borrow
        INV-003: Transaction fails if field does not exist
        INV-004: Immutable borrow does not allow mutation
    end note

    note right of q_check_type
        INV-005: Value type parameter must exactly match stored type
        INV-006: Dynamic object fields accessed via borrow are not accessible by ID externally
    end note
